                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Ah, I'm fairly local, I've been around",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I've seen the streets you're walkin' down",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
