                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Even if my clique were to pick and the people were to vote",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "It's the few, the proud, and the emotional",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Yo, you, bulletproof in black like a funeral",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "The world around us is burnin', but we're so cold",
